# Metropolis Neon, west half (C4a, contract 39), 34 x 23. column = i, row = j. The east half arrives at the EAST edge (i = 33, rows 12..13); the avenue runs west to the CLOSED GATE of the Autopista
# (C5b: the west end (0,12..13) now leads to Ruta 16: the sign at (3,11) points the way; the guard is gone). The same cyberpunk look (neon blocks, holo billboards, lamps, cars). The PLANT GYM (the greenhouse building, door g) stands in a pocket closed by a
# CUTTABLE BUSH; the MANSION (a block with a door, `mansion_neon`); the casino (the casino: a block with NO door, a guard and a sign: closed for renovation in C4a, C4b gives it a door).
@map metropolis_neon_2
@size 34 23
@interior no
@area metropolis_neon
@bg 0
@fill sidewalk
@spawn east 32 12 W
@spawn gym_door 6 8 S
@spawn mansion_door 22 8 S
@spawn casino_door 15 19 S
@spawn prize_door 18 19 S
@spawn diner_door 30 20 S
@spawn west 1 12 E
@legend
  .  tile=sidewalk
  a  object=chain_i
  b  object=chain_j
  c  object=nblock_0
  d  object=nblock_1
  e  object=gym_neon
  f  door=gym_neon
  g  door=nblock_1
  h  object=bush
  i  object=sign text=neon.gym.sign interact=look
  j  cut=yes
  k  npc=vecino_m id=npc_a face=SE text=neon.npc.d
  l  object=road_sign text=neon.west.sign interact=look
  m  object=lamp_s
  o  tile=asph
  Z  tile=asph
  q  tile=asph
  r  object=sign text=neon.holo.c interact=look
  s  object=road_sign text=neon.sign.b interact=look
  t  npc=mama id=npc_b face=NW text=neon.npc.e
  u  object=sign text=neon.casino.sign2 interact=look
  G  door=nblock_0
  P  door=nblock_1
  D  door=nblock_0
  V  object=sign text=neon.prize.sign interact=look
  W  object=sign text=neon.diner.sign interact=look
  H  tile=sidewalk hidden=vigor_drop   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
  bbccdd..ddccddccddcc..ccddccddcc.b
  bbccdd..ddccddccddcc..ccddccddcc.b
  bb...............................b
  bb..........H....................b
  bb...........cc..................b
  bb...eee.....cc..dd..dd....cc....b
  bb...efe.........dd..dg....cc....b
  bb...h.h.i.......................b
  bb...hjh.........................b
  bb..........k....................b
  bb.l.....m......m.......m......m.b
  Zooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooq
  Zooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooq
  bb.....m...r.......m...s...m.....b
  bb........................t......b
  bb...............................b
  bb....dd......cc.dd...dd.........b
  bb....dd......cG.dP...dd.....cc..b
  bb...........u.....V.........cD..b
  bb..........................W....b
  bb...............................b
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
@warp f -> gimnasio_neon spawn=door
@warp g -> mansion_neon spawn=door
@warp q -> metropolis_neon spawn=west
@warp Z -> ruta_16 spawn=east
@warp G -> casino_neon spawn=door
@warp P -> sala_premios spawn=door
@warp D -> restaurante_neon spawn=door
